  "descriptionMarkdown": "# **(2.0) Tileable Nuclear Power Plant for Krastorio 2**\n### I couldn't find a good tileable nuclear power plant blueprint anywhere so I just made it myself. It features:\n- Perfect ratio\n- Compact design\n- Options to build on top of water or on land\n- Circuit network that is built in and ready to use to maximize efficiency and to not waste any uranium fuel cells\n- Max heat bonus from stacking reactors next to each other  \n- Built in roboports for easy construction\n\nOne blueprint is 390 tiles long and 10 tiles wide (2 reactors side to side wide)\n\nYou have to supply uranium fuel cells through the logistics system and have a storage space in it for depleted uranium cells.  \nMinimum reactors for proper ratios is 8 (Two \"Side Part\" blueprints side to side without any \"Body Part\" blueprints).  \n\nTo use first place \"Side Part\" blueprint then place side to side as many as you want \"Body Part\" blueprints, lastly place another \"Side Part\" Blueprint.   \nYou should end up with two \"Side Part\" blueprints on both ends and some number of \"Body Part\" blueprints in between them.  \nAnd of course always line up the reactors, even if one blueprint is smaller.  ",
